Comment: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:22.05,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.35,0:12:29.10,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just before Operation Odessa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the White Base was critically damaged\Nin combat, and made a crash landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:58.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Although the Zeon attack force\Nhad withdrawn for the time being...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...there was no telling\Nwhen they would attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:42.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one on the right should be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we use the cord for the engine No. 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think the scale is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.99,0:02:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.57,0:02:56.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kai! Someone's going to call you\Na coward again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see what the pressure is here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:11.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we manage with what we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:15.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.\NWe've tried everything, but it's no go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. If the enemy attacked now, we'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are getting supplies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. We made a request to General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.32,0:03:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Mirai, Mr. Bright is calling for you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Mirai, Mr. Bright is calling for you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.09,0:03:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it, Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to be my substitute.\NTake over for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:43.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A ship without a commander\Nseems pathetic. But... I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.36,0:03:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of us can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm filled with shame when I think\Nthat my fear may be what's making me ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here are the basics of ship command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you study this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... that's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:03:59.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.15,0:04:02.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll do it, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.21,0:04:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. I'll try my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, having received\Nthe White Base's resupply request...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...General Revil of the Federation Forces\Nhad arrived at the European frontline base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This was so that Operation Odessa could\Nhappen before Rear Admiral Kycilia...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:28.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...sent reinforcements to M'Quve's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, prior to this offensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:37.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if the attack is coming from\Njust one ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...if M'Quve is attacked from behind,\Nhe'll panic and make his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I understand they're badly damaged\Nafter M'Quve's attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This plan might work because\Nthey assume that, General Elran.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.69,0:04:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rest depends on whether your squadron...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...can repair the White Base's engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:02.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In addition, there's another item\NI want you to deliver to the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though they'll probably resent\Nbeing the guinea pigs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:16.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want them to do the testing\Nfor the Gundam's power-up mecha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam's...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's the documentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:21.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.01,0:05:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General Revil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:26.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you giving so much support\Nto a unit that hasn't been properly organized?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.81,0:05:30.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't use the regular military\Nfor experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is also the decision of General HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.05,0:06:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for informing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:13.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you don't know any details\Nabout the Gundam's power-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:18.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unfortunately, General Elran didn't have{\i}\N{\i1}a chance to check before the White Base...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.07,0:06:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:23.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell Elran that he should restrain himself\Nin the Odessa offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:24.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, the Federation is getting impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In this battle, the first to move will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clink. Take 3 Goufs with 3 Dodai YSs...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and hit the Medea transport team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:39.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take escort fighters as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:08.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:09.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A coded message from\NGeneral Revil just came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've deciphered it with the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll display it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Revil. My apologies{\i}\N{\i1}for taking so long to contact you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lieutenant Matilda is delivering{\i}\N{\i1}your supplies.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must join Operation Odessa{\i}\N{\i1}as soon as repairs are complete.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.26,0:07:32.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've also sent along{\i}\N{\i1}new parts for the Gundam.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure they will be quite useful in battle.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hope the pilots will fight better with them.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.77,0:07:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's it? We don't even know\Nwhen Operation Odessa begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Ms. Matilda...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.95,0:07:48.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...I mean, Lieutenant Matilda...\Nwill give us the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:49.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the new Gundam parts are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:57.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it's something that'll make it easier\Nfor Amuro and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Detecting a formation at 11 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:11.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just when we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Zeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:12.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:14.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There can't be that many people\Naware of our movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All units, prepare for anti-air combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maintain current combat formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Send General Revil an SOS, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.88,0:08:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transports weighed down by their cargo\Nare a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.68,0:08:52.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Receiving an SOS from\Nthe Medea transport squadron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:55.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Medea?! What's the distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,180 km, northwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:08:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:02.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Without those supplies...{\i}\N{\i1}the White Base can't move.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need the Medea to come to us.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla. We need to assist\Nthe Medea transport squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Kai! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:15.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please launch!\NWe're rescuing Matilda's squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda's in trouble...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Wait, Sayla! Stop the launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... Without the Core Fighters...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.09,0:09:31.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...the immobile White Base\Nwill be defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:33.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the enemy hits us then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:37.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, go to the Core Fighter!\NJob John and Hayato, to the Gunperry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Load the Gundam parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:40.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kai, to the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that made you angry, you can punish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright left me in charge...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.91,0:10:01.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Matilda's transport squadron\Nis bringing us emergency supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:06.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Sayla, you always flatter us.\NHere I go, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gunperry, heading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll just have to pray that\Nthe enemy doesn't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai. Why don't you\Ngo sit in the captain's seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's more relaxing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:36.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should have everyone\Non anti-aircraft watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:37.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda.\NPlease hang on until I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Matilda! No. 5's been hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter! Fly lower to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.85,0:11:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not touching Ms. Matilda,\Nor the supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a Core Fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very fast, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.08,0:11:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But is it a match for those\NZeon mobile suits, the Goufs...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:27.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Dopps are no problem.\NBut where are the Goufs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:35.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Down! Down! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:59.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's one Gouf...! Next...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:08.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to get between the enemy\Nand the Medea, or I'll hit Ms. Matilda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Mr. Kai!\NI'm running out of ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do repairs...\NRepairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:42.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to do what you can\Nwhile there's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be reading that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.47,0:13:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's true, Ryu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:06.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The way you did it wasn't the smartest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:09.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you taught us all by your example.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A person's value depends\Non what that person does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You were strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:19.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...that's why I want to be like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:25.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make your own decisions...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro, I'm entering the docking area!\NCan you make it here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I read you, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:48.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy aircraft at 5 o'clock!\NWe don't have data on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid. We've got\Nall the data on the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see it now! A splitting type!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A splitting type?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the one that carries\Nthe Gundam mobile suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Habe, cease attack on the Medeas!\NWe're going after the splitting type!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:08.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Splitting type? What's that?!\NIs the mobile suit in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. Have the remaining Dopps\Nchase the fighters away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:20.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! You're going to transfer\Nto the Gundam right here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to! The Core Fighter\Nisn't enough to defeat the Goufs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Activating laser searcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laser searcher activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Synchronizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:38.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Gouf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now! Get the fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy here's a bit slow, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.49,0:14:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hurry up and do the Gundam thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Give me cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:56.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are Goufs around the Medea, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see that!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:15:00.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Docking searcher... activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.34,0:15:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,10... 9...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,6... 5...\NReleasing B Parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Searcher synchronized!\NReleasing A Parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Converting to a mobile suit, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:35.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Gouf! You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope that's not Ms. Matilda's!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:52.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. 1! No. 4 is down!{\i}\N{\i1}Please go on ahead!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. 4 has the Gundam's power-up mecha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:57.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to land the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:16:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But our two aircraft can still get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't abandon the Gundam's\Npower-up mecha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They landed?!\NThis is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! Is it that Gouf again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Get the G-Mecha unloaded!\NWe're going to blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep up the anti-air fire!\NThere's one enemy mobile suit left!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.79,0:16:57.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:17:00.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Matilda's going to be hit\Nunless you get here quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:02.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, I should probably\Ntry to shoot it down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:07.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Power up the G-Fighter's engines.\NWe'll have the Gundam use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think he'll learn to use it that quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.76,0:17:11.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does a commander do at time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.41,0:17:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:40.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai, at times like this, we feel safe\Nwhen a commander looks calm and confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No enemies closing in, are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:50.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No sign of any. The Medea transports\Nseem to be stalled as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, Sayla, can you inform\Nthe mechanics?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cancel level 1 battle stations\Nand resume repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, the enemy doesn't have\Nmuch fighting strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why it's taking them so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. They won't come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:19.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn Gouf! Seems to be\Ngetting stronger and stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I do it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:27.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he finished?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He got me! My engine...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:48.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! My leg circuits are all shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to get to Ms. Matilda, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:18:59.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai, has Matilda's squadron arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.00,0:19:05.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything's fine.\NThey say they should be here in 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.17,0:19:11.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. They got through\Nthe Zeon siege, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that's why they made her\Na First Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'd like to rest some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't move freely!\NWhat to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll be over-powered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What to do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this it...?!\NNo, you're not going to get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:20:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the power-up mecha\NMs. Matilda brought!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can put the Gundam on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right...! Let's try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:11.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lost too much power already!\NI'm taking you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Ram him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Turn! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The G-Fighter...\NSo that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:29.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well done, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got the report.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ms. Mirai. As acting commander,{\i}\N{\i1}you protected the Medea squadron well.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.15,0:21:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd like you now to{\i}\N{\i1}contact the Medea squadron...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and expedite repairs to the White Base.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel more and more ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't, Mirai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You held on well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you were able\Nto put Bright at ease, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:05.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sayla.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It means a lot to me,\Ncoming from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:13.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With all this, the White Base\Nwill be fixed up in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.36,0:22:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the second time\NI've been saved by you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.57,0:22:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Amuro and Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Kai too. Today must have\Nbeen the toughest on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... That was nothing, really...\NPractically a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so dependable, Kai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.22,0:22:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, let's have you take a look\Nat all the new Gundam power-up parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm going to try even harder\Nand get even better...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:58.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Matilda dies protecting\Nthe White Base...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...along with many of her brave comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.72,0:23:28.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Dom heavy mobile suits,\Nnicknamed the Black Tri-Stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:31.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...make for an unrelenting\Nshow of ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:36.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NBlack Tri-Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.65,0:23:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
